1051:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * Check if angle is within arc background bounds
1052:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  *
1053:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * In order to avoid unexpected value update of the arc value when the user clicks
1054:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * outside of the arc background we need to check if the angle (of the clicked point)
1055:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * is within the bounds of the background.
1056:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  *
1057:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * A tolerance (extra room) also should be taken into consideration.
1058:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  *
1059:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * E.g. Arc with start angle of 0° and end angle of 90°, the background is only visible in
1060:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * that range, from 90° to 360° the background is invisible. Click in 150° should not update
1061:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * the arc value, click within the arc angle range should.
1062:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  *
1063:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * IMPORTANT NOTE: angle is always relative to bg_angle_start, e.g. if bg_angle_start is 30
1064:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * and we click a bit to the left, angle is 10, not the expected 40.
1065:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  *
1066:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * @param obj   Pointer to lv_arc
1067:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * @param angle Angle to be checked. Is 0<=angle<=360 and relative to bg_angle_start
1068:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * @param tolerance_deg Tolerance
1069:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  *
1070:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  * @return true if angle is within arc background bounds, false otherwise
1071:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/arc/lv_arc.c ****  */
